<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Galerija LEGO setova</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #ffcf00;
            height: 50px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:visited {
            color: #ddd;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffcf00;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        nav a:active {
            color: #d01012;
        }

        nav a:focus {
            outline: 2px dashed #ffcf00;
            background-color: #555;
        }

        nav a[target="_blank"] {
            color: #ffcf00;
        }

        nav a[target="_blank"]::after {
            content: " \2197";
        }

        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        p {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .gallery img {
            width: 30%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            padding: 5px;
            background-color: white;
        }

        .gallery img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        img[src$=".jpg"] {
            border-style: solid;
            border-width: 4px;
        }

        img[data-set="city"] {
            border-color: #0055BF;
        }

        img[data-set="technic"] {
            border-color: #333333;
        }

        img[data-set="friends"] {
            border-color: #E91E63;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header></header>
    
    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Početna</a>
        <a href="o-nama.html">O nama</a>
        <a href="galerija.html" class="active">Galerija</a>
        <a href="kontakt.html">Kontakt</a>
        <a href="https://www.lego.com" target="_blank">Službeni LEGO</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Galerija LEGO setova</h1>
        <p>Ovdje možete vidjeti nekoliko LEGO setova iz naše kolekcije.</p>

        <div class="gallery">
            <img src="city1.jpg" alt="Lego City Bus" data-set="city">
            <img src="technic1.jpg" alt="Lego Technic Car" data-set="technic">
            <img src="friends1.jpg" alt="Lego Friends House" data-set="friends">
            
            <img src="city2.jpg" alt="Lego City Construction" data-set="city">
            <img src="technic2.jpg" alt="Lego Technic Helicopter" data-set="technic">
            <img src="friends2.jpg" alt="Lego Friends Treehouse" data-set="friends">
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
